2: $\forall i = 1, 2, \ldots, K : Q(i) = 0, \text{count}(i) = 0;$ 3: for $t = 1, 2, \ldots, T$ do
4: k = 从 $1, 2, \ldots, K$ 中根据式(16.4)随机选取
5: v = R(k);
6: r = r + v;
7: $Q(k) = \frac{Q(k) \times \text{count}(k) + v}{\text{count}(k) + 1}$ ;
8: count(k) = count(k) + 1;
9: end for
输出：累积奖赏 r  
